WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.800 --> 00:00:10.900
Welcome and navigation
Review this learner's enrolment answers step by step. Use the step navigation and progress indicators. Close wizard returns to the learner record.

2
00:00:10.900 --> 00:00:19.800
Before you begin
Read the preparation guidance before entering information. Check which details and evidence are needed. The published form controls the steps and questions shown.

3
00:00:19.800 --> 00:00:28.900
Personal details
Check the learner's name, contact details and other personal information. Required questions and format messages help identify incomplete or invalid answers.

4
00:00:28.900 --> 00:00:38.100
ILR learner details
For apprenticeship learners, review the Individualised Learner Record details. Check the learner's declarations and evidence; do not guess missing information.

5
00:00:38.100 --> 00:00:47.100
Extended ILR
Review the additional funding and learner information shown in this step. Complete applicable follow-up questions and declarations. Commercial enrolment skips the ILR steps.

6
00:00:47.100 --> 00:00:56.000
CV and job description
Review the learner's experience and the CV or job-description evidence requested by this form. Check uploaded evidence before moving on.

7
00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:05.000
Personal Learning Record
Review prior qualifications and the Personal Learning Record information. Check the evidence and any details already captured for the learner.

8
00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:14.000
Skills Radar
Review the learner's self-assessment against the programme competencies. Staff review mode preserves the learner's own responses rather than replacing their ratings.

9
00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:23.100
Inclusion
Review the inclusion guidance and recorded assessment status. This status comes from the connected safeguarding assessment, rather than a status you can invent here.

10
00:01:23.100 --> 00:01:32.100
Policies
Review the policy documents and required acknowledgements. Read each document before confirming that it has been understood.

11
00:01:32.100 --> 00:01:39.613
Next steps and submission
Read what happens next and review incomplete steps. Submit only after checking the learner's information. A successful submission returns you to the profile.
